    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "8 Ardmore Park is an exceptional turnkey 3-bedroom semi-detached residence finished to a high standard and meticulously maintained throughout. Combining modern comfort, energy efficiency, and generous living space, this impressive home is ideally suited to families, first-time buyers, or anyone seeking a property ready for immediate occupation.\r\n\r\nThe home benefits from a full external insulation wrap, significantly enhancing warmth and energy performance while contributing to lower running costs. Internally, the accommodation is bright, spacious, and thoughtfully laid out, comprising two welcoming reception lounges that provide excellent flexibility for family living, entertaining, or working from home.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are two generously proportioned double bedrooms along with a versatile box room, ideal as a child’s bedroom, nursery, dressing room, or home office.\r\n\r\nTo the rear lies a beautifully tranquil garden offering a private retreat from busy day-to-day life. The garden also features a fully electrified shed, perfect for storage, a workshop, gym, hobby space, or remote working setup.\r\n\r\nFurther benefits include off-street parking, a side entrance providing convenient rear access, and a peaceful residential setting close to local amenities, schools, parks, and transport links.\r\n\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a stylish, energy-efficient family home where every detail has been carefully considered — a true walk-in property requiring absolutely no further outlay."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Pvc and Composite Doors and windows\r\nLocation\r\nTranquill garden\r\nOff Street Parking\r\nSide Entrance\r\nFully Wrapped and new boiler\r\nTurnkey"
      },
      {
